    {
      "item": "The Create Role page only displays permissions for features that your organization has access to.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          15
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "After you have finished selecting permissions for the role, click Next.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          66,
          70
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "(Optional) In the Assign Scope (Optional) section, select one of the following scopes from the menu:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          18,
          41
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Locations: Choose locations for the role to apply to.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          9
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Location Groups: Choose location groups for the role to apply to.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          15
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Departments: Choose departments for the role to apply to.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          11
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Applications: Choose applications for the role to apply to. This scope is only available when compatible Digital Experience permissions are selected.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          12
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Time Duration: Choose a time duration for the role from 2 Hours to 48 Hours, or select Full Access for the role to always be available. This scope is only available when compatible Digital Experience permissions are selected, and only applies to those permissions.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          13
        ],
        [
          56,
          63
        ],
        [
          67,
          75
        ],
        [
          87,
          98
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "After you have finished assigning a scope to the role, click Next.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          61,
          65
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Add Details section, enter a Name and Description for the role.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 6,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          18
        ],
        [
          36,
          40
        ],
        [
          45,
          56
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save and activate the change.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 7,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After a role has been created, it can be assigned. To learn more, see Configuring Roles Assignments."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Editing a Role",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To edit a role:"
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Role Management page (Administration > Role Management > Role Management), locate the role you want to edit.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          29,
          43
        ],
        [
          46,
          61
        ],
        [
          64,
          79
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click the Edit icon for the role you want to modify.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          10,
          14
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Edit Role page, you can make changes to the permissions, scope, and details for the role.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          16
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "After you finish all of your edits, click Save and activate the change.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          42,
          46
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Duplicating a Role",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Roles can be duplicated to create new roles. Duplicating roles is a quick way to create roles with minor differences or different scopes."
    },
    {
      "text": "To duplicate a role:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Administration > Role Management > Role Management, and locate the role you want to duplicate.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          20
        ],
        [
          23,
          38
        ],
        [
          41,
          56
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click the Duplicate icon for the role you want to copy.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          10,
          19
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Duplicate Role page, you can make changes to the permissions, scope, and details for the role before it is duplicated.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          21
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "After you confirm the details of the role, click Save and activate the change.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          49,
          53
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Role duplicates do not retain assignments from the source role. The duplicate role has no assignments.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "heading": "Deleting a Role",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Rules can be deleted as long as they have no assignments."
    },
    {
      "text": "To delete a role:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Administration > Role Management > Role Management, and locate the role you want to delete.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          20
        ],
        [
          23,
          38
        ],
        [
          41,
          56
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click the Delete icon for the role you want to delete. You can only click the icon if the role has no assignments.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          10,
          16
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "A confirmation window for deleting the role appears.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "In the confirmation window, click Delete and activate the change.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          34,
          40
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    }
  ]
}
